Subject: [PATCH 007/156] Harden Antarctic configuration loading

- Reject invalid YAML without overwriting it and create missing parent directories through Bukkit
- Exclude persistence from reflective option loading and keep comments in a standard YAML header
- Add creation, reload and invalid-file regression tests
- Correct attribution to Dionysus and Pufferfish without asserting undocumented author permission

